stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RESETTING : arranque del servidor
    RESETTING --> FREE : safe_state OK
    RESETTING --> FAULT : safe_state falla
    FAULT --> RESETTING : reintento automático<br/>o force-release
    FREE --> LOCKED : acquire
    LOCKED --> RESETTING : release · vencimiento<br/>heartbeat perdido · force · apagado

    classDef free fill:#ffffff,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d,stroke-width:2px
    classDef busy fill:#ffffff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1e3a8a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef reset fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f,stroke-width:2px
    classDef fault fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d,stroke-width:2px
    class FREE free
    class LOCKED busy
    class RESETTING reset
    class FAULT fault
